Package: tc9564-dkms
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, tc9564-firmware (= ${source:Version})
Description: Qualcomm TC9564 PCIe Ethernet driver (DKMS)
 Sources for the tc956x_pcie_eth kernel module, configured for the
 TC9564 (QPS615) physical functions and Qualcomm platform support.
 DKMS builds the module for installed kernels with matching headers.
 .
 RB3 Gen2 requires a boot image containing its staging device-tree
 overlay and explicit activation through VendorDtbOverlays. See the
 installed README.Debian for setup and verification instructions.

Package: tc9564-firmware
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: firmware for the TC9564 PCIe Ethernet bridge
 Toshiba TC956X PCIe bridge firmware used by the Qualcomm TC9564
 (QPS615) Ethernet driver. Installs TC956X_Firmware_PCIeBridge.bin into
 the system firmware directory for loading by the host driver.
